#let frontmatter = (
  title: "Home",
  template: "layout.typ",
)

Welcome to your new Baudelaire site. Edit `content/index.typ` to change this
page, add posts under `content/posts/`, and style everything in
`assets/style.css`.

Your first post lives at #link("/content/posts/hello.typ")[posts/hello]. Linking
by its `.typ` source path (rather than its URL) means the link is checked at
build time and survives any later change to the page's `slug` or permalink.

